# __APP_NAME__

Generated by the MP Frontend CLI. This app consumes packed platform packages and has no source alias into
another repository. Product labels and behavior belong to authored overrides. The first slice is the
public catalog: a list route and a detail route over one generated read. Protected writes, identity and
retained realtime require their separate gates.

See [docs/overview.md](docs/overview.md) for the routes and the layout, and
[docs/api-contracts.md](docs/api-contracts.md) for the contracts. `.env.example` names the environment
variables the app reads, without values.
